                "## ⚙️ Pipeline & Data Quality\n",
                "\n",
                "| Metric | Value |\n",
                "|---|---|\n",
                "| **Bronze Closures** | 2,006 rows ingested |\n",
                "| **Bronze Businesses** | 37,345 rows (15 dropped by DQ) |\n",
                "| **Silver Closures** | 4,012 rows (exploded both streets) |\n",
                "| **Gold Fact Table** | 1,376,228 daily compensation records |\n",
                "| **Eligible Businesses** | 11,813 on affected streets |\n",
                "| **Affected Streets** | 87 with active closures |\n",
                "| **DQ Drop Rate** | 0.04% (15/37,360) |\n",
                "\n",
                "**Architecture**: Medallion (Bronze→Silver→Gold) with Auto Loader + CDC\n",
                "**Compute**: 100% serverless — sub-4-minute end-to-end runs\n",
                "**Schedule**: Daily at 06:00 AM Jerusalem time"
              ]
            }
